     "a": "Below are the list of some of the features provided by create react app.\ni. React, JSX, ES6, Typescript and Flow syntax support.\nii. Autoprefixed CSS\niii. CSS Reset/Normalize\niv. A live development server\nv. A fast interactive unit test runner with built-in support for coverage reporting\nvi. A build script to bundle JS, CSS, and images for production, with hashes and\nsourcemaps\nvii. An offline-first service worker and a web app manifest, meeting all the Progressive\nWeb App criteria."
